            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ceijae"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We have been making these for years. My 4 kids age 18-24 still want them every Halloween. They are also known as Skeleton Teeth and Witch's Teeth. If the apples get too moist pat them dry or the peanut butter will not stick. Don't worry about getting an exact amount of peanut butter on each side. Easier to eat without the top 'lip'. Have fun."
          },
